SUMMARY:Watch Party: March Madness Women's Championship 
LOCATION:The Pub
DESCRIPTION:Category: Sports & Games\nPrice: Free / Included\nStatus: Avail
 able\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/180136\n\nThe roa
 d to glory ends here. From the best seats in town\, we present the 2026 Wo
 men's March Madness Championship game - where every buzzer-beater and game
 -changing moment unfolds from the big screen. The Pub's signature fan favo
 rites\, paired perfectly with a pint (or two) are served all game long.\n\
 nMembers sporting their alma mater apparel will enjoy our soft\, salted pr
 etzel and all the accompaniments for a perfect dunk on the 'House. Whether
  you're in it to win it\, or here for the camaraderie\, experience the fin
 al chapter with us.\n\n*Reservations are encouraged to guarantee seating.\
 n\nMake a Reservation.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/180136
CATEGORIES:Sports & Games
END:VEVENT
