 ed three-course dinner. Enjoy expertly paired wines as you engage with fel
 low members\, guided by conversation prompts designed to inspire deeper\, 
 more memorable exchanges. This unique experience offers the perfect blend 
 of great company\, engaging dialogue\, and a menu crafted to delight the s
 enses.\n\n*Tickets are $100 per person\, plus tax\, and are reserved for m
 embers only. Cancellations within 72 hours of the event\, or failure to at
 tend\, will be charged in full. Please inform us of any dietary needs or r
 estrictions by emailing happening@thequin.com at least 72 hours before din
 ner service.
