SUMMARY:Member Mingle
LOCATION:The Living Room
DESCRIPTION:Category: Member Mixer\nPrice: Free\nStatus: Waitlist Only\nEve
 nt URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/177706\n\nJoin us for our 
 weekly Member Mingle\, an inclusive gathering set in an ambiant reserved s
 pace. This is your opportunity to connect with fellow members\, exchange i
 deas\, and cultivate meaningful relationships.\n\nWhether you're sparking 
 new collaborations\, sharing insights\, or simply enjoying great conversat
 ion\, the Member Mingle is the perfect way to engage with our dynamic comm
 unity. Don’t miss the chance to connect\, inspire\, and be inspired!\n\n
 *This event is complimentary and reserved for members only. Complimentary 
 light bites will be served\, and beverages will be available for purchase.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/177706
