SUMMARY:Taste of Provence 
LOCATION:Café Q
DESCRIPTION:Category: Food & Beverage\nPrice: Free / Included\nStatus: Avai
 lable\nTime: 5 PM – 9 PM\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/ev
 ents/177695\n\nLet your senses drift to the sun-soaked South of France wit
 h Taste of Provence\, a dinner experience celebrating the bright\, rustic 
 elegance of the region’s cuisine. Available exclusively during dinner se
 rvice\, this limited-time offering honors Provence’s devotion to seasona
 l ingredients\, fragrant herbs\, and unhurried conviviality. Each course 
 captures Provence’s effortless marriage of countryside abundance and coa
 stal refinement.\n\nMake a Reservation.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/177695
CATEGORIES:Food & Beverage
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:quin-event-179439@thequinhouse.com
DTSTAMP:20260404T064357Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260413T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260413T183000
SUMMARY:Author Talk: "Our World in Ten Buildings" with Michael P. Murphy
LOCATION:The Muse
DESCRIPTION:Category: The Arts\nPrice: Free\nStatus: You are Confirmed\nEve
 nt URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/179439\n\n5:00PM Reception
 \, 5:30PM Discussion\nDiscover the profound impact of architecture on our 
 daily lives with Our World in Ten Buildings. In this illuminating work\, 
 architectural designer and author Michael P. Murphy examines ten landmark 
 projects\, from hospitals to memorials\, to reveal how thoughtfully design
 ed spaces shape the way we think\, feel\, and connect.\n\nBlending persona
 l experience with deep research\, Murphy shows how architecture influences
  our health\, behavior\, and sense of community\, challenging the notion t
 hat purposeful design is only for the privileged. Accessible yet deeply in
 sightful\, this book offers a fresh perspective on the built environment a
 nd its power to transform our homes\, workplaces\, and shared spaces.\n\n*
 This event is complimentary and reserved for members only. Light bites and
  refreshments will be served.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/179439
CATEGORIES:The Arts
END:VEVENT
