SUMMARY:'Quin Chat: Rethinking Women's Health - Look Good\, Feel Good
LOCATION:Scottie's
DESCRIPTION:Category: Health & Wellness\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 79 spot
 s left\nStatus: futureSale\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/ev
 ents/180901\n\n5:00PM Reception\, 5:30PM Discussion \nAn exploration of v
 itality\, strength\, and wellbeing\, this thoughtfully curated conversatio
 n - moderated by Jay Luthar MD\, Founder and Medical Director of Lutanen H
 ealth & Faculty at Harvard Medical School - brings together leading voices
  in women’s health for a discussion designed to inform\, inspire\, and e
 mpower.\n\nTogether\, Melissa Hines\, Founder of Wellest Integrative Healt
 h\, Kathy Kates\, Family Nurse Practitioner\, and Izzy Antonelli\, Exercis
 e Physiologist & Strength and Conditioning Specialist\, will guide a dynam
 ic discussion spanning sexual health\, hormonal care\, movement\, metaboli
 sm\, bone health\, and longevity. With perspectives grounded in pelvic hea
 lth\, clinical expertise\, and exercise physiology\, the conversation offe
 rs a holistic view of how we support and sustain the body through every st
 age of life.\n\nThe dialogue invites a deeper understanding of how these i
 nterconnected elements shape not only how we feel day to day\, but how we 
 move\, age\, and thrive over time—bringing clarity\, nuance\, and action
 able insight to essential aspects of women’s health.\n\nThoughtful\, eng
 aging\, and rooted in expertise\, this program offers members an opportuni
 ty to reconnect with their bodies and approach wellbeing with intention an
 d confidence.\n\n*This event is complimentary and reserved for members onl
 y. Complimentary light bites will be served\, and beverages will be availa
 ble for purchase.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/180901
CATEGORIES:Health & Wellness
END:VEVENT
