SUMMARY:'Quin Chat: The Atlantic's Nick Thompson 
LOCATION:Scottie's
DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Quin Chat\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 79 spots lef
 t\nStatus: futureSale\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/
 180909\n\n5:00PM Reception\, 5:30PM Discussion \nStep into a wide-ranging
  conversation with Nicholas Thompson\, CEO of The Atlantic. During his te
 nure\, the publication has won the National Magazine Award for General Exc
 ellence three times\, become one of the fastest-growing news organizations
  in the country\, and reached record profitability and subscriber growth i
 n its 157-year history. He is also the author of the national bestseller 
 The Running Ground and host of the podcast The Most Interesting Thing in
  AI\, where he explores the rapidly evolving world of artificial intellige
 nce.\n\nThompson will be joined in conversation by Claire Hughes Johnson\,
  a technology leader and former Chief Operating Officer of Stripe. Togeth
 er\, they will explore the forces shaping today’s media and technology l
 andscapes - from the future of AI and innovation to the evolving role of s
 torytelling and leadership in a rapidly changing world.\n\n*This event is 
 complimentary and reserved for members only. Light bites and refreshments 
 will be served.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/180909
CATEGORIES:‘Quin Chat
END:VEVENT
