 aitlist Only\nTime: 4 PM – 7 PM\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse
 .com/events/166318\n\nClaim your place in a private ’Quin Suite (#B31) a
 t Gillette Stadium for the highly anticipated England v. Ghana World Cup m
 atchup. Enter through a dedicated suite entrance and settle into reserved 
 seating with sweeping views of the pitch\, all while enjoying continuous f
 ood and beverage service throughout the match. A curated assortment of pre
 set dishes showcases local culinary talent\, complemented by premium champ
 agne\, wine\, beer\, spirits\, mocktails\, and soft drinks. World-class fo
